      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This same issue occurs if you're using a 3DConnexion 3D mouse/ Space mouse, except with the 3D Mouse the only solution is to uninstall the driver, not simply unplug the device. Rendering it a PITA to use a 3D mouse - which might be OK if you weren't creating content with programs that use the 3D mouse, like Blender, ZBrush, 3D Coat, etc.",
      "viewerReactions": null
